{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-03-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES RECEIPT OF COVID-19 INNOVATION AWARD FROM CITEAB', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, MARCH 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS R&D SYSTEMS AND NOVUS BRANDS HAVE BEEN NAMED WINNERS OF THE CITEAB COVID-19 INNOVATION AWARD.\xa0 THIS AWARD CELEBRATES INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS OR PRODUCTS THAT HELPED SHAPE THE LIFE SCIENCES SECTORS UNDERSTANDING OF, OR RESILIENCE TO COVID-19.'}